Directus Studio: discard stale responses in the item view and its siblings (prepared, not submitted).
Base: directus/directus tag v12.5.1 (2cd112f1a1afe42829d2e4de899d07ce4394649c). Apply with: git apply directus.patch
Evidence and test results: docs/adoption/hunts/directus.md in genclass-dev/GenClass-lib.

- app/src/composables/use-item/index.ts: the fix for the reported bug (generation counter in getItem()).
- use-template-data.ts, use-relation-single.ts, input-autocomplete-api.vue: the same class, separable.
- Tests: 3 in use-item/index.test.ts, 1 each in use-template-data.test.ts, use-relation-single.test.ts and the new
  input-autocomplete-api.test.ts. Each fails on v12.5.1 and passes with the patch.

